      "containerId": "kbcPxYgvzhuxrxgkO0aFb",
      "originalText": "A user maintains .xlsx files and Power BI reports\n\n\n.csv files are created to better track diffs through versioning\n\nPower BI supports importing data from either .csv or .xlsx",
